// # LLVM IR Backend — Module Entry Door
//
// Logline: Re-exports textual LLVM IR generation, JIT execution, and PGO optimization interfaces.
//
// Setup: Imports internal LLVM backend siblings and provides clean public re-exports.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import LLVM IR emitter, type mapping, and runtime shim siblings.
//   2. Re-export public LLVM streaming and JIT engine interfaces.
//   3. Maintain <= 256 lines limit.

